X:4
T:Bounce High, Bounce Low
O:USA
C:traditional
R:children's ball-bouncing chant
S:traditional, as commonly sung in classrooms
M:2/4
L:1/8
K:C
.(G2 A2 | G2 !breath!E2) | .(.G.G .A.A | G2 E2) |]
w: Bounce high, bounce low, bounce the ball to Shi-loh.

